        },
        "question_LiGA6x": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who should not use a weighted blanket?",
            "answer": "<p>Using a weighted blanket may not be suitable for individuals who have difficulty removing it from their body due to its weight. Furthermore, people with certain medical conditions such as sleep apnea, breathing difficulties like asthma, sleep disorders, or claustrophobia, should either refrain from using a weighted blanket or consult with a physician before doing so.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_fd8tBM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do your materials contain dangerous chemicals?",
            "answer": "<p>All of Nodpod's materials meet and exceed the most stringent state and federal agencies' guidelines for safe materials.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_JAx63J": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does 3-minute magic mean I'll be asleep in 3 minutes?",
            "answer": "<p>Most people describe a feeling of relaxation, which is attributed to the science of Deep Touch Pressure within minutes. Not everyone experiences the same feeling as quickly. If you are not fully satisfied with your Nodpod we would be happy to refund you. </p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_R3imNA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns"
          }
        },
        "question_QdMGrH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Return Policy",
            "answer": "<p>Any order purchased from nodpod.com* can be returned within 30 days. If not completely satisfied, simply return the product for a prompt refund.</p><p>For easy returns use our Easy Returns Portal <a href=\"https://nodpod.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Nodpod Loop Returns\">here.</a></p><p>*Products purchased from any other retailer or website (Amazon, Anthropologie, Nordstrom, etc.) must be returned to the original seller.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_9cpRzM": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping"
          }
        },
        "question_VnExQr": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Return Policy",
            "answer": "<p>Nodpod products can be shipped to anywhere that has a physical address within the USA. We ship to PO Boxes.</p><p>There is a 1-3 business day process time for all orders. While we strive to ship an order within 3 working days, we can’t directly control the delivery times beyond our end.</p><p>As a general rule, assume that your shipment will take 5–7 working days. APO addresses will be shipped via USPS and cannot be rush shipped.</p><p>Orders that do not qualify for free shipping are $6.99 flat rate. Free shipping threshold applies to subtotal. (cart amount after discounts and before tax)</p><p>Any free shipping promotions only qualify for addresses within the contiguous United States.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_7FWVi3": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Sale Policy"
          }
        },
        "question_URPdqV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sale Policy",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Sale Duration</strong></p><p>LIMITED TIME ONLY. Sale dates use Pacific Time (PT) as a standard and end on the date indicated. If no end time is specified, the end time is assumed to be 11:59 PM. If no end date is specified, the sale may end at any time without prior warning.</p><p><strong>Exclusions</strong></p><p>Online price reflects discount. Offer available for select styles only. No substitutions will be allowed. Advertised sale prices cannot be combined with any other offer, discount, or coupon. No adjustments on previous purchases will be permitted. Only orders completed within the defined sales period qualify for sales price. Nodpod® reserves the right to cancel any order for any reason. Offers subject to change without notice.</p><p><strong>Price Matching</strong></p><p>Nodpod.com does not price match any retailer (online or brick and mortar).</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_UEztLw": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Guarantee Policy"
          }
        },
        "question_BpAhU8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Guarantee Policy",
            "answer": "<p>We proudly stand behind all of our products. Nodpod® has a 30 day money back guarantee, but, if for any reason you’re not satisfied, send it back for a full product refund, no questions asked. Products purchased from any other retailer or website (Amazon, Nordstrom, etc.) must be returned to the original seller.</p><p>The return will only be accepted if you have contacted us prior to returning. Please email us at hello@nodpod.com or call us toll free at 888.486.4224.</p><p>The shipping cost of a returned item is at your expense. We recommend using a method of shipping that allows you to track your package, as we are not responsible for items lost in transit.</p><p>Your return will be processed within 7-10 business days.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        }
      },
